        "name": null,
        "description": "> [!NOTE]\n> The second release candidate of v10.0.0. The first, [v10.0.0-rc1](https://github.com/pyTooling/pyTooling/releases/tag/v10.0.0-rc1) ([#321](https://github.com/pyTooling/pyTooling/pull/321)), was tagged, but PyPI rejected its upload. These notes cover the whole release.\n>\n> This release accumulated **222 merged pull-requests**, so the notes below are grouped by section and, within each section, by namespace rather than enumerating every class. The linked pull-requests carry the per-item detail, and `doc/News.rst` carries the reader-facing version of the same list.\n>\n> * ✨ New packages `pyTooling.ControlFlow`, `pyTooling.CallGraph`, `pyTooling.CI`, `pyTooling.REST`, `pyTooling.Documentation` and `pyTooling.Graph.GraphViz`; traces render as Gantt charts and export OTLP/JSON; SPDX license expressions, version expressions and epochs; a test report format with four names per item.",
